TI  - Uniportal video-assisted thoracoscopic lobectomy in the animal model.
PG  - S656-9
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2014.10.03 [doi]
AB  - We introduce the training on uniportal video-assisted thoracoscopic (VATS) 
      lobectomy in sheep. This animal model is helpful to learn the different view, the 
      importance of lung exposure and the key points of the instrumentation. In this 
      article we present three videos with the left upper lobectomy, the left lower 
      lobectomy and the right upper lobectomy in the sheep.
