TI  - The experience of using Endo GIA™ Radial Reload with Tri-Staple™ Technology for 
      various lung surgery.
PG  - 1482-4
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2014.09.06 [doi]
AB  - Endo GIA™ Radial Reload with Tri-Staple™ Technology (RR) is a device for 
      colorectal surgery. However, with its rounded staple line, Radial Reload is 
      suitable for various lung surgeries. We use the device for lung wedge resection, 
      and cutting bronchus in lung lobectomy. The total number of use counts up to 56 
      fires, and all fires came out well.
