TI  - Thymic carcinoma developing in a multilocular thymic cyst.
PG  - 512-5
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2012.03.05 [doi]
AB  - Thymic carcinoma developing in a pre-existing thymic cyst has rarely been 
      reported in literature. The diagnosis of this entity in the past has always been 
      established after surgery. We are reporting a case of thymic carcinoma that 
      developed in a pre-existing multilocular thymic cyst in an elderly male. The 
      diagnosis was based on imaging findings and confirmed on fine needle aspiration 
      cytology (FNAC).
